:"https://assets.airfarewatchdog.com/images/home/review-1.webp"},{rating:5,title:"Martinique, $200 roundtrip",content:"When I saw this fare, I had a few vacation days left to use up. So I booked it! If it wasn’t for the deal, I wouldn’t have thought Martinique was affordable. Turns out, it’s cheaper than visiting my sister in Miami!",username:"Aline",userSubscriptionYear:1998,image:"https://assets.airfarewatchdog.com/images/home/review-2.webp"},{rating:5,title:"Guadeloupe, $162 roundtrip",content:"AWD helped my girlfriend and I book a super cheap flight to Guadeloupe last February. We weren’t actually looking, just clicking around exploring cheap flights from Boston. $160 roundtrip to the Caribbean was too good to pass up...",username:"Jason",userSubscriptionYear:2008,image:"https://assets.airfarewatchdog.com/images/home/review-3.webp"}],bgIndex:8,homeLocation:{location:{typeIds:"10038+10004",airportCode:"OMA",cityCode:false,city:{typeIds:"10004",id:60885,primaryName:"Omaha",type:{typeId:10004,typeName:"City"},preferred:true,latlon:{lat:41.25835,lon:-95.934669},hierarchy:{leaf:{id:60885,typeId:10004,name:"Omaha",parent:{id:28948,typeId:10003,name:"Nebraska",parent:{id:191,typeId:10001,name:"United States",parent:{id:19,typeId:10000,name:"North America",parent:{id:1,typeId:9999,name:"World"}}}}},locale:"en_US",usTradeStatusToCountry:"UNKNOWN",countryCode:"US"},names:{locale:"en_US",names:{name:"Omaha",primary:"Omaha","display-med":"Omaha, Nebraska","display-min":"Omaha, NE","display-long":"Omaha, Nebraska, United States"}},tagScores:null,zone:"na.us.ne.omaha",dmaCode:652},hierarchy:{leaf:{id:84279631,typeId:10038,name:"Omaha, NE - Eppley Airfield",parent:{id:60885,typeId:10004,name:"Omaha",parent:{id:28948,typeId:10003,name:"Nebraska",parent:{id:191,typeId:10001,name:"United States",parent:{id:19,typeId:10000,name:"North America",parent:{id:1,typeId:9999,name:"World"}}}}}},locale:"en_US",usTradeStatusToCountry:"UNKNOWN",countryCode:"US"},zone:"na.us.ne.omaha",latlon: